*   **Contextual Resolution**: In "I code in Python," the word "code" 
will have a high attention score relative to "Python," signaling to 
the model that it is the programming language. In "A Python bit me," 
the word "bit" will have a high score, signaling that "Python" is a snake.

### Origins

The entire mechanism was introduced in a landmark 2017 research paper 
titled ***Attention Is All You Need***. This paper introduced the 
**Transformer architecture**, which is the backbone for modern LLMs 
like *Gemini* and *DeepSeek*, relying entirely on this attention 
mechanism to process information effectively.